-| 4096 | astropy-12906 | 161,863 | 199.656 | Planner DSML; unresolved |
-| 4096 | requests-6027 | 142,210 | 146.360 | Planner DSML; unresolved |
-| 8192 | astropy-12906 | 158,379 | 289.454 | Planner DSML; unresolved |
